## Tables

### `app.analytics.accounts`

User accounts

#### Columns

| Column | Type | Nullable | Default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `tenant_id` | `BIGINT` | no | - |  |
| `account_id` | `BIGINT` | no | `nextval('analytics.account_id_seq')` |  |
| `email` | `VARCHAR` | no | - | Canonical email address |
| `normalized_email` | `VARCHAR` | yes | - | generated as `CAST(lower(email) AS VARCHAR)` |
| `status` | `ENUM('active', 'disabled')` | no | `'active'` |  |
| `balance` | `DECIMAL(18,2)` | no | `0` |  |
| `metadata` | `STRUCT("source" VARCHAR, tags VARCHAR[])` | yes | - |  |


#### Constraints

| Name | Kind | Columns | Details |
|---|---|---|---|
| - | `NOT NULL` | `tenant_id` | `NOT NULL` |
| - | `FOREIGN KEY` | `tenant_id` | `FOREIGN KEY (tenant_id) REFERENCES analytics.tenants(tenant_id)` |
| - | `PRIMARY KEY` | `account_id` | `PRIMARY KEY(account_id)` |
| - | `NOT NULL` | `email` | `NOT NULL` |
| - | `NOT NULL` | `status` | `NOT NULL` |
| - | `NOT NULL` | `balance` | `NOT NULL` |
| - | `UNIQUE` | `tenant_id, email` | `UNIQUE(tenant_id, email)` |
| - | `CHECK` | `balance` | `CHECK((balance >= 0))` |
| - | `NOT NULL` | `account_id` | `NOT NULL` |


#### Indexes

| Name | Terms | Unique | Origin / details | Predicate |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `accounts_email_idx` | `[email]` | no | duckdb | - |


#### DuckDB

**Temporary:** no

```sql
CREATE TABLE analytics.accounts(tenant_id BIGINT NOT NULL, account_id BIGINT DEFAULT(nextval('analytics.account_id_seq')) PRIMARY KEY, email VARCHAR NOT NULL, normalized_email VARCHAR GENERATED ALWAYS AS(lower(email)), status ENUM('active', 'disabled') DEFAULT('active') NOT NULL, balance DECIMAL(18,2) DEFAULT(0) NOT NULL, metadata STRUCT("source" VARCHAR, tags VARCHAR[]), FOREIGN KEY (tenant_id) REFERENCES analytics.tenants(tenant_id), UNIQUE(tenant_id, email), CHECK((balance >= 0)));
```


